(3, 1, '2026-07-06 16:13:34', '2026-07-06 16:13:34', '\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Last updated 12 August 2026.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This policy explains what information this website collects, why it is collected, and what happens to it. It is written to describe how the site actually works rather than to cover every possibility in the abstract. If anything here is unclear, please ask — the contact details are at the bottom.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who runs this website</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This site belongs to Tanya Barrans, a licensed real estate broker in Washington State, brokered by John L Scott Real Estate. Each John L Scott office is independently owned and operated. Tanya is responsible for the information collected here.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What this site collects, and when</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">When you send a message through the contact form</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The contact form asks for your name and email address, and optionally your phone number, what you are thinking about, your timing, how you prefer to be contacted, and anything you would like Tanya to know. All of it is voluntary apart from your name and email, which are needed in order to reply.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What you send is stored in Follow Up Boss, the client management system Tanya uses to keep track of conversations. It is used to answer your enquiry and to follow up about it. Nothing you send through this form is added to a marketing mailing list unless you separately sign up for the newsletter.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">When you sign up for the newsletter</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The newsletter form asks for your email address and, optionally, your first name. These are stored in Flodesk, the email service used to send the newsletter, and are used only to send it. Every newsletter includes an unsubscribe link, and unsubscribing takes effect immediately.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">When you simply browse</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This site uses Google Analytics to understand how the site is used in aggregate — which pages are read, roughly where visitors come from, and whether anything is broken. Google Analytics sets cookies and collects information such as your approximate location, device and browser, and the pages you visit. It is used to improve the site, not to identify you personally.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can opt out of Google Analytics entirely by installing the <a href=\"https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>, or by blocking cookies in your browser settings. The site works normally either way.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Like almost all websites, the web server also keeps standard technical logs — IP address, browser type, and the time of each request — which are used for security and troubleshooting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">When you use tools embedded from other companies</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Two tools on this site are run by other companies, and using them means dealing with those companies directly as well:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Homebot</strong> — the home value and buying power tools on the Buying and Selling pages are provided by Homebot and appear inside a frame on this site. Anything you enter into those tools goes to Homebot under their own privacy policy.</li>\n<li><strong>Google Calendar scheduling</strong> — booking a conversation with Tanya uses a Google scheduling page. What you enter there is processed by Google.</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who your information is shared with</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Your information is never sold, rented, or traded.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is shared only with the service providers that make the site work — Follow Up Boss, Flodesk, Google Analytics, Homebot, and the company hosting the website — and only so they can perform that service. It may also be shared where the law requires it, or with a lender, title company, inspector, or brokerage staff when that is a necessary part of a transaction you have asked Tanya to help with.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How long it is kept</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Enquiries and client records are kept for as long as needed to work with you and afterwards for as long as real estate record-keeping rules require. Newsletter subscriptions are kept until you unsubscribe. You may ask for your information to be deleted at any time, and it will be unless a law or a records requirement means it has to be kept.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your choices</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Unsubscribe from the newsletter using the link in any email.</li>\n<li>Ask what information is held about you, or ask for it to be corrected or deleted, by emailing Tanya.</li>\n<li>Ask to stop being contacted at any time.</li>\n<li>Turn off analytics cookies using the opt-out link above or your browser settings.</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Requests are honoured regardless of where you live. There is no need to explain why you are asking.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Security</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The site is served over an encrypted connection, and form submissions are sent to the systems above over encrypted connections. No website can promise perfect security, but access to the systems holding your information is limited to Tanya and the people who need it to help with your enquiry.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Children</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This site is meant for adults and is not directed at children under 13. If a child has sent information through the site, please get in touch and it will be deleted.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Changes to this policy</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If the site starts collecting something new, or starts using a new service, this page will be updated and the date at the top will change.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Getting in touch</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Questions about this policy, or about information held about you, can go to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tanya Barrans<br>Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@tanyabarrans.com\">info@tanyabarrans.com</a><br>Phone: <a href=\"tel:+14255374728\">(425) 537-4728</a><br>Brokered by John L Scott Real Estate</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n', 'Privacy Policy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'open', '', 'privacy-policy', '', '', '2026-08-20 01:59:03', '2026-08-20 01:59:03', '', 0, 'https://tanyabarrans.com/?page_id=3', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(4, 0, '2026-07-06 16:15:01', '2026-07-06 16:15:01', '<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Home\",\"url\":\"/\",\"kind\":\"custom\",\"isTopLevelLink\":true} /-->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Buy\",\"url\":\"/buy/\",\"kind\":\"custom\",\"isTopLevelLink\":true} /-->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Sell\",\"url\":\"/sell/\",\"kind\":\"custom\",\"isTopLevelLink\":true} /-->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Listings\",\"url\":\"/listings/\",\"kind\":\"custom\",\"isTopLevelLink\":true} /-->\n<!-- wp:navigation-submenu {\"label\":\"Neighborhoods\",\"url\":\"/neighborhoods/\",\"kind\":\"custom\",\"isTopLevelItem\":true} -->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"All neighborhoods\",\"url\":\"/neighborhoods/\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /-->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Renton\",\"url\":\"/renton/\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /-->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Kent\",\"url\":\"/kent/\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /-->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Covington\",\"url\":\"/covington/\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /-->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Maple Valley\",\"url\":\"/maple-valley/\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /-->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Newcastle\",\"url\":\"/newcastle/\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /-->\n<!-- /wp:navigation-submenu -->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"The Journal\",\"url\":\"/blog/\",\"kind\":\"custom\",\"isTopLevelLink\":true} /-->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"About Tanya\",\"url\":\"/about/\",\"kind\":\"custom\",\"isTopLevelLink\":true} /-->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Contact\",\"url\":\"/contact/\",\"kind\":\"custom\",\"isTopLevelLink\":true} /-->', 'Navigation', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'navigation', '', '', '2026-08-20 22:18:57', '2026-08-20 22:18:57', '', 0, 'https://tanyabarrans.com/navigation/', 0, 'wp_navigation', '', 0),
(5, 0, '2026-07-06 16:29:19', '2026-07-06 16:29:19', '', 'Home', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'home', '', '', '2026-07-06 16:29:19', '2026-07-06 16:29:19', '', 0, 'https://tanyabarrans.com/home/', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(6, 0, '2026-07-06 16:29:20', '2026-07-06 16:29:20', '<!-- wp:pattern {\"slug\":\"tanya-barrans/about-intro\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"720px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n\n	<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\",\"textColor\":\"dusty-blush\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center tb-eyebrow has-dusty-blush-color has-text-color\">Your Local Real Estate Expert</p>\n	<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n	<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"x-large\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-x-large-font-size\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">Real relationships. Remarkable results.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n	<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n	<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color\">Buying or selling a home is one of the biggest decisions you\'ll make, and it shouldn\'t feel like you\'re figuring it out alone. Whether you\'re searching for your first home, selling the place where you\'ve made years of memories, or simply wondering if now is the right time to make a move, my job is to give you honest advice, a smart strategy, and the confidence to move forward.</p>\n	<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n	<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n	<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color\">I\'ve built my business around knowing the communities I serve — not just the statistics, but the neighborhoods, schools, commute patterns, hidden gems, and market trends that help my clients make better decisions. From Renton and Kent to Maple Valley, Covington, Newcastle, and the surrounding communities, I know what makes each area unique because this is home, too.</p>\n	<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n	<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n	<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color\">Every client receives a customized marketing and pricing strategy designed around their goals, not a one-size-fits-all plan. Professional photography, Zillow Showcase, video, digital marketing, and strategic negotiation all work together to help you achieve the best possible outcome.</p>\n	<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n	<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n	<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color\">But here\'s what I hope you\'ll remember most. By the time we get to closing, there\'s a good chance we\'ll be talking about more than real estate. I\'ll probably have you planning your first vegetable garden, convincing you to try homemade sourdough, or texting you recommendations for the best local spots after you\'ve moved in. Because while I love helping people buy and sell homes, my favorite part has always been the relationships that come with it.</p>\n	<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n	<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n	<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color\">Many of my clients become friends, and some of my favorite compliments have nothing to do with the sale itself. They’re the messages that say, <em>“We couldn’t imagine going through this without you,”</em> or <em>“By the end, you felt like family.”</em></p>\n	<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n	<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontFamily\":\"serif\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"italic\",\"fontSize\":\"1.375rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.5\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n	<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-serif-font-family\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);font-size:1.375rem;font-style:italic;line-height:1.5\">My goal isn\'t just to help you find the right house. It\'s to help you feel at home long before you unpack the first box.</p>\n	<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"alabaster\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1200px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-alabaster-background-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n\n	<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\"} -->\n	<p class=\"has-text-align-center tb-eyebrow\">A Little More Personality</p>\n	<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n	<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"xx-large\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n	<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-xx-large-font-size\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">Real estate, minus the stuffiness</h2>\n	<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n	<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\">\n\n		<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"tb-reveal\"} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-column tb-reveal\">\n			<!-- wp:image {\"id\":19,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"tb-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n			<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full tb-card has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/gallery-1.jpg\" alt=\"Tanya Barrans smiling, seated\" class=\"wp-image-19\" style=\"border-radius:4px;aspect-ratio:3/4;object-fit:cover;width:100%\"/></figure>\n			<!-- /wp:image -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n		<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"tb-reveal\"} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-column tb-reveal\">\n			<!-- wp:image {\"id\":25,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"tb-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n			<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full tb-card has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/gallery-2-new.jpg\" alt=\"Tanya Barrans smiling, hands on hips\" class=\"wp-image-25\" style=\"border-radius:4px;aspect-ratio:3/4;object-fit:cover;width:100%\"/></figure>\n			<!-- /wp:image -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n		<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"tb-reveal\"} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-column tb-reveal\">\n			<!-- wp:image {\"id\":21,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"tb-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n			<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full tb-card has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/gallery-3.jpg\" alt=\"Tanya Barrans laughing, full length\" class=\"wp-image-21\" style=\"border-radius:4px;aspect-ratio:3/4;object-fit:cover;width:100%;object-position:top\"/></figure>\n			<!-- /wp:image -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n', 'About', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'about', '', '', '2026-08-20 05:40:06', '2026-08-20 05:40:06', '', 0, 'https://tanyabarrans.com/about/', 1, 'page', '', 0),
(7, 0, '2026-07-06 16:29:20', '2026-07-06 16:29:20', '<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-large-font-size\">Buying a home is exciting and overwhelming, sometimes in the same afternoon. Whether it\'s your first place or your fifth, I\'ll help you navigate it with a clear plan, honest advice, and zero pressure.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"tb-topo-bg\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"alabaster\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1200px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull tb-topo-bg has-alabaster-background-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n\n	<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\"} -->\n	<p class=\"has-text-align-center tb-eyebrow\">The Process</p>\n	<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n	<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"xx-large\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}}} -->\n	<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-xx-large-font-size\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">From first search to closing day</h2>\n	<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n	<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\">\n\n		<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"tb-card tb-reveal\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"base\"} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-column tb-card tb-reveal has-base-background-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\"} -->\n			<p class=\"tb-eyebrow\">Step 1</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n			<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n			<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Let\'s Talk</h3>\n			<!-- /wp:heading -->\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n			<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">A no-pressure conversation about your budget, timeline, and what you\'re actually looking for — not just a checklist of features.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n		<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"tb-card tb-reveal\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"base\"} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-column tb-card tb-reveal has-base-background-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\"} -->\n			<p class=\"tb-eyebrow\">Step 2</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n			<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n			<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Search</h3>\n			<!-- /wp:heading -->\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n			<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">Private showings, honest neighborhood insight, and early alerts on homes that fit — before they\'re all over your feed.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n		<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"tb-card tb-reveal\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"base\"} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-column tb-card tb-reveal has-base-background-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\"} -->\n			<p class=\"tb-eyebrow\">Step 3</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n			<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n			<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Offer</h3>\n			<!-- /wp:heading -->\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n			<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">A pricing strategy grounded in real local data, and someone in your corner through every round of negotiation.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n		<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"tb-card tb-reveal\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"base\"} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-column tb-card tb-reveal has-base-background-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\"} -->\n			<p class=\"tb-eyebrow\">Step 4</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n			<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n			<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Closing Day</h3>\n			<!-- /wp:heading -->\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n			<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">Inspections, appraisals, title, and escrow — all handled and explained in plain English, right up to the keys in your hand.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"tb-eyebrow\">Where I Work</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"fontSize\":\"x-large\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-x-large-font-size\">Renton, Kent, and the surrounding Puget Sound</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color\">I focus on Renton, Kent, Covington, Maple Valley, Newcastle, and the communities around them — not because it\'s convenient, but because I actually know these neighborhoods: the schools, the commutes, the hidden gems, and what a fair price really looks like block by block. If you\'re searching somewhere nearby that isn\'t listed here, reach out anyway — there\'s a good chance I can still help.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n	<!-- wp:button -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/listings/\">Find Your Next Home</a></div>\n	<!-- /wp:button -->\n\n	<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"tb-button-outline\",\"textColor\":\"ink\"} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-button tb-button-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-ink-color has-text-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Get In Touch</a></div>\n	<!-- /wp:button -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n', 'Buy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'buy', '', '', '2026-07-08 21:58:51', '2026-07-08 21:58:51', '', 0, 'https://tanyabarrans.com/buy/', 2, 'page', '', 0),
(8, 0, '2026-07-06 16:29:21', '2026-07-06 16:29:21', '<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-large-font-size\">Selling the place where you\'ve made memories is personal — and getting it sold for what it\'s worth takes more than a sign in the yard. Here\'s how I get your home ready, seen, and sold.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"tb-topo-bg\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"alabaster\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1200px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull tb-topo-bg has-alabaster-background-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n\n	<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\"} -->\n	<p class=\"has-text-align-center tb-eyebrow\">The Process</p>\n	<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n	<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"xx-large\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}}} -->\n	<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-xx-large-font-size\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">From pricing strategy to sold</h2>\n	<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n	<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\">\n\n		<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"tb-card tb-reveal\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"base\"} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-column tb-card tb-reveal has-base-background-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\"} -->\n			<p class=\"tb-eyebrow\">Step 1</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n			<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n			<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pricing Strategy</h3>\n			<!-- /wp:heading -->\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n			<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">A customized pricing plan based on real local data — not a national average that has no idea what street you live on.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n		<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"tb-card tb-reveal\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"base\"} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-column tb-card tb-reveal has-base-background-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\"} -->\n			<p class=\"tb-eyebrow\">Step 2</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n			<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n			<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Staging &amp; Photos</h3>\n			<!-- /wp:heading -->\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n			<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">Staging guidance, professional photography, and video that shows your home at its best from the very first click.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n		<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"tb-card tb-reveal\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"base\"} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-column tb-card tb-reveal has-base-background-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\"} -->\n			<p class=\"tb-eyebrow\">Step 3</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n			<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n			<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Marketing</h3>\n			<!-- /wp:heading -->\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n			<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">Zillow Showcase, digital marketing, and strategic exposure that puts your listing in front of the right buyers, fast.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n		<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"tb-card tb-reveal\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"base\"} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-column tb-card tb-reveal has-base-background-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\"} -->\n			<p class=\"tb-eyebrow\">Step 4</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n			<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n			<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Negotiation &amp; Close</h3>\n			<!-- /wp:heading -->\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n			<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">Firm, fair negotiation on every offer, then a smooth path through inspections, appraisal, and closing.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"tb-eyebrow\">What\'s Included</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"fontSize\":\"x-large\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-x-large-font-size\">Full-service, start to finish</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"0\"}}},\"className\":\"is-style-none\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list is-style-none\" style=\"padding-left:0\">\n	<!-- wp:list-item --><li>Comparative market analysis &amp; pricing strategy</li><!-- /wp:list-item -->\n	<!-- wp:list-item --><li>Staging consultation</li><!-- /wp:list-item -->\n	<!-- wp:list-item --><li>Professional photography &amp; video</li><!-- /wp:list-item -->\n	<!-- wp:list-item --><li>Zillow Showcase &amp; digital marketing</li><!-- /wp:list-item -->\n	<!-- wp:list-item --><li>Strategic negotiation on every offer</li><!-- /wp:list-item -->\n	<!-- wp:list-item --><li>Guidance through inspections, appraisal, and closing</li><!-- /wp:list-item -->\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n	<!-- wp:button -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Get a Listing Plan</a></div>\n	<!-- /wp:button -->\n\n	<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"tb-button-outline\",\"textColor\":\"ink\"} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-button tb-button-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-ink-color has-text-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/listings/\">See Recent Sales</a></div>\n	<!-- /wp:button -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n', 'Sell', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'sell', '', '', '2026-07-08 21:58:55', '2026-07-08 21:58:55', '', 0, 'https://tanyabarrans.com/sell/', 3, 'page', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(9, 0, '2026-07-06 16:29:22', '2026-07-06 16:29:22', '<!-- wp:html -->\n<style>\nbody.page-id-9 .wp-block-post-title{display:none!important}\n.tb-listings-page{width:100vw;max-width:none!important;margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw);margin-top:-1px;overflow:hidden}\n.tb-listings-page-hero{position:relative;min-height:clamp(520px,63vw,720px);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(30,50,75,.23),rgba(30,50,75,.02)),url(\'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/renton-pending.jpg\') center 55%/cover no-repeat;overflow:hidden}\n.tb-listings-page-hero:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:50% 0 0;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(26,47,70,.2));pointer-events:none}\n.tb-listings-hero-card{position:relative;z-index:1;width:min(650px,calc(100% - 48px));margin:0 0 -54px max(5vw,24px);padding:clamp(34px,5vw,64px);background:#fbf7f1;color:#344c6a;box-shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(35,52,73,.2)}\n.tb-listings-kicker,.tb-listings-page .tb-eyebrow{font-size:.72rem!important;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#b46f88!important}\n.tb-listings-hero-card h2{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,5.4vw,5.2rem);line-height:.92;margin:.5rem 0 1.25rem;letter-spacing:-.03em}\n.tb-listings-hero-card h2 em{color:#c27e98;font-weight:inherit}\n.tb-listings-hero-card p{font-size:clamp(1rem,1.3vw,1.18rem);line-height:1.7;max-width:540px}\n.tb-listings-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:26px}\n.tb-listings-btn{display:inline-block;padding:14px 22px;background:#344c6a;color:white!important;text-decoration:none!important;font-size:.76rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;border:1px solid #344c6a;transition:.2s}\n.tb-listings-btn.alt{background:transparent;color:#344c6a!important}\n.tb-listings-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);background:#c27e98;border-color:#c27e98;color:white!important}\n.tb-listings-page #current-listings{padding-top:125px!important}\n.tb-listings-page #current-listings .tb-sales-grid{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:28px}\n.tb-listings-page #current-listings .tb-card{padding:0;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 15px 45px rgba(52,76,106,.1);overflow:hidden;transition:.25s}\n.tb-listings-page #current-listings .tb-card:hover{transform:translateY(-7px);box-shadow:0 22px 60px rgba(52,76,106,.17)}\n.tb-listings-page #current-listings .tb-sales-photo{height:clamp(300px,32vw,440px);overflow:hidden}\n.tb-listings-page .tb-sales-photo img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .55s}\n.tb-listings-page .tb-card:hover .tb-sales-photo img{transform:scale(1.035)}\n.tb-listings-page #current-listings .tb-card p{padding-left:24px;padding-right:24px}\n.tb-listings-page #current-listings .tb-card p:first-of-type{font-size:1.45rem;margin-top:1.25rem!important}\n.tb-listings-page #current-listings .tb-card p:last-child{padding-bottom:24px;font-size:.88rem!important}\n.tb-listings-page .has-alabaster-background-color .tb-sales-grid{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px}\n.tb-listings-page .has-alabaster-background-color .tb-card{padding:0 0 18px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 10px 35px rgba(52,76,106,.08);overflow:hidden}\n.tb-listings-page .has-alabaster-background-color .tb-sales-photo{height:260px}\n.tb-listings-page .has-alabaster-background-color .tb-card p{padding-left:18px;padding-right:18px}\n.tb-listings-page .has-alabaster-background-color .tb-card strong{font-size:1.15rem}\n.tb-listings-proof{padding:32px 24px;background:#344c6a;color:#fff;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);text-align:center;gap:1px}\n.tb-listings-proof div{padding:10px 20px;border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25)}\n.tb-listings-proof div:last-child{border:0}.tb-listings-proof strong{display:block;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:1.35rem}.tb-listings-proof span{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.8}\n.tb-listings-final{background:#344c6a;color:#fff;padding:clamp(60px,8vw,110px) 24px;text-align:center}\n.tb-listings-final-inner{max-width:850px;margin:auto}.tb-listings-final .tb-listings-kicker{color:#efb6c8!important}\n.tb-listings-final h2{color:#fff;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4.8vw,4.7rem);line-height:1.03;margin:12px 0 18px}.tb-listings-final p{max-width:620px;margin:0 auto 28px;font-size:1.08rem;line-height:1.7}\n.tb-listings-final .tb-listings-btn{background:#efb6c8;border-color:#efb6c8;color:#344c6a!important}.tb-listings-final .tb-listings-btn.alt{background:transparent;color:#fff!important;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.7)}\n@media(max-width:800px){.tb-listings-page-hero{min-height:560px;background-position:center}.tb-listings-hero-card{width:calc(100% - 32px);margin:0 16px -40px;padding:32px 25px}.tb-listings-page #current-listings{padding-top:92px!important}.tb-listings-page #current-listings .tb-sales-grid,.tb-listings-page .has-alabaster-background-color .tb-sales-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tb-listings-page #current-listings .tb-sales-photo{height:360px}.tb-listings-proof{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tb-listings-proof div{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25)}}\n\n.tb-listings-page #current-listings .tb-eyebrow,.tb-listings-page .has-alabaster-background-color .tb-eyebrow{color:#6F8A74!important}\n.tb-listings-page #current-listings .tb-card{border-bottom:6px solid #6F8A74}\n.tb-listings-page .has-alabaster-background-color .tb-card:nth-child(3n+2){border-bottom:4px solid #6F8A74}\n.tb-listings-page .tb-listings-btn.alt:hover{background:#6F8A74;border-color:#6F8A74;color:#fff!important}\n.tb-listings-proof{border-top:8px solid #6F8A74}\n\n.tb-listings-page .has-alabaster-background-color .tb-sales-grid{align-items:stretch}\n.tb-listings-page .has-alabaster-background-color .tb-card{height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;border-bottom-width:4px}\n.tb-listings-page .has-alabaster-background-color .tb-sales-photo{height:250px;min-height:250px}\n.tb-listings-page .tb-sold-link{display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:100%;color:inherit!important;text-decoration:none!important}\n.tb-listings-page .tb-sold-link>p:first-of-type{margin-top:1rem!important}\n.tb-listings-page .tb-sold-price{font-weight:700;color:#344c6a!important;margin-bottom:.3rem!important}\n.tb-listings-page .tb-sold-details{margin:.05rem 0 0!important;font-size:.78rem!important;min-height:1.5rem}\n.tb-listings-page .tb-sold-more{display:block;margin:auto 18px 0;padding-top:14px;font-size:.67rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#6F8A74}\n\n.tb-recent-sales{background:#fbf8f4;padding:clamp(70px,8vw,110px) 32px}.tb-recent-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:auto}.tb-recent-sales h2{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4.4vw,4.2rem);color:#344c6a;margin:.4rem 0 3rem}.tb-recent-sales .tb-sales-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px;align-items:stretch}.tb-recent-sales .tb-card{background:#fff;height:455px!important;box-shadow:0 10px 35px rgba(52,76,106,.08);overflow:hidden;border-bottom:4px solid #6F8A74;height:100%;min-height:405px}.tb-recent-sales .tb-sales-photo{height:250px;min-height:250px}.tb-recent-sales .tb-card p{padding:0 18px;margin:.15rem 0}.tb-recent-sales .tb-card p:first-of-type{margin-top:1rem;font-size:1.15rem}.tb-recent-sales .tb-sold-more{padding-bottom:18px}@media(max-width:800px){.tb-recent-sales .tb-card{height:auto!important;min-height:430px}.tb-recent-sales .tb-sales-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tb-recent-sales{padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px}}\n.tb-local-preview-intro{max-width:650px;margin:-2rem auto 3rem;text-align:center;line-height:1.7;color:#59616b}.tb-local-preview-card{color:inherit!important;text-decoration:none!important}.tb-local-preview-card .tb-sold-details{padding:0 18px}.tb-local-preview-card .tb-sold-more{padding-bottom:18px}\n.tb-listings-reviews{background:#fff;padding:clamp(50px,7vw,90px) 24px;text-align:center}\n.tb-listings-reviews-inner{max-width:700px;margin:0 auto 8px}\n.tb-listings-reviews h2{color:#344c6a;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.2rem);line-height:1.05;margin:10px 0 0}\n.tb-listings-reviews-widget{max-width:960px;margin:0 auto}\n</style>\n<div class=\"tb-listings-page\">\n<section class=\"tb-listings-page-hero\">\n <div class=\"tb-listings-hero-card\">\n  <div class=\"tb-listings-kicker\">Renton · Kent · Covington · Puget Sound</div>\n  <h2>Homes with a story.<br><em>Moves with a strategy.</em></h2>\n  <p>See what is on the market now, then explore a selection of homes Tanya has helped buy and sell across the Puget Sound.</p>\n  <div class=\"tb-listings-actions\"><a class=\"tb-listings-btn\" href=\"/contact/\">Talk About Your Move</a><a class=\"tb-listings-btn alt\" href=\"#current-listings\">View Current Listings</a></div>\n </div>\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"tb-topo-bg\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"sand\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1200px\"}} -->\n<div id=\"current-listings\" class=\"wp-block-group alignfull tb-topo-bg has-sand-background-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center tb-eyebrow\">Current Listings</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"xx-large\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-xx-large-font-size\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">See what\'s available now</h2>