(12, 2, '2026-07-06 16:29:28', '2026-07-06 16:29:28', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Choosing where to live around the Puget Sound is about more than the house — it\'s about the commute, the schools, the coffee shop you\'ll walk to on Saturday mornings. Here are five neighborhoods first-time buyers should have on their radar this year.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Placeholder Neighborhood</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is sample content for Tanya to replace with her real local knowledge — what the neighborhood feels like, typical price ranges, and who it suits best.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>This is a placeholder post demonstrating the blog format. Replace with real content.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n', 'Top 5 Neighborhoods for First-Time Buyers Around Puget Sound', '', 'draft', 'open', 'open', '', 'top-5-neighborhoods-for-first-time-buyers-around-puget-sound', '', '', '2026-08-17 22:04:06', '2026-08-17 22:04:06', '', 0, 'https://tanyabarrans.com/?p=12', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(13, 2, '2026-07-06 16:29:29', '2026-07-06 16:29:29', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thinking about listing this summer? Here\'s what the numbers are telling us about inventory, days on market, and pricing across the Puget Sound region — and what it means for your sale.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The short version</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sample content for Tanya to replace with a real market update — recent stats, trends she\'s seeing with her own listings, and practical advice for sellers deciding on timing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>This is a placeholder post demonstrating the blog format. Replace with real content.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n', 'What Sellers Should Know About the Summer 2026 Market', '', 'draft', 'open', 'open', '', 'what-sellers-should-know-about-the-summer-2026-market', '', '', '2026-08-17 22:04:06', '2026-08-17 22:04:06', '', 0, 'https://tanyabarrans.com/?p=13', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(14, 2, '2026-07-06 16:29:30', '2026-07-06 16:29:30', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before you sign that offer, slow down for ten minutes and ask these questions. They can save you tens of thousands of dollars — or save you from the wrong house entirely.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. How long has it been on the market?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sample content for Tanya to replace — what days-on-market signals in this region, and how it should shape your offer strategy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>This is a placeholder post demonstrating the blog format. Replace with real content.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n', '10 Questions to Ask Before Making an Offer', '', 'draft', 'open', 'open', '', '10-questions-to-ask-before-making-an-offer', '', '', '2026-08-17 22:04:06', '2026-08-17 22:04:06', '', 0, 'https://tanyabarrans.com/?p=14', 0, 'post', '', 0),
