en-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ravensdale.jpg\" alt=\"Sold home in Ravensdale, WA\"/></div>\n			<p style=\"margin:0.75rem 0 0\"><strong>Ravensdale, WA</strong></p>\n			<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"margin:0.15rem 0 0\">$2,040,000</p>\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-card tb-reveal\"} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-card tb-reveal\">\n			<div class=\"tb-sales-photo\"><span class=\"tb-sales-tag\">Sold</span><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/seattle.jpg\" alt=\"Sold home in Seattle, WA\"/></div>\n			<p style=\"margin:0.75rem 0 0\"><strong>Seattle, WA</strong></p>\n			<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"margin:0.15rem 0 0\">$1,200,000</p>\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-card tb-reveal\"} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-card tb-reveal\">\n			<div class=\"tb-sales-photo\"><span class=\"tb-sales-tag\">Sold</span><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/shoreline.jpg\" alt=\"Sold home in Shoreline, WA\"/></div>\n			<p style=\"margin:0.75rem 0 0\"><strong>Shoreline, WA</strong></p>\n			<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"margin:0.15rem 0 0\">$1,030,000</p>\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-card tb-reveal\"} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-card tb-reveal\">\n			<div class=\"tb-sales-photo\"><span class=\"tb-sales-tag\">Sold</span><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/bellevue.jpg\" alt=\"Sold home in Bellevue, WA\"/></div>\n			<p style=\"margin:0.75rem 0 0\"><strong>Bellevue, WA</strong></p>\n			<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"margin:0.15rem 0 0\">$1,255,000</p>\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-card tb-reveal\"} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-card tb-reveal\">\n			<div class=\"tb-sales-photo\"><span class=\"tb-sales-tag\">Sold</span><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/gigharbor.jpg\" alt=\"Sold home in Gig Harbor, WA\"/></div>\n			<p style=\"margin:0.75rem 0 0\"><strong>Gig Harbor, WA</strong></p>\n			<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"margin:0.15rem 0 0\">$600,000</p>\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-card tb-reveal\"} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-card tb-reveal\">\n			<div class=\"tb-sales-photo\"><span class=\"tb-sales-tag\">Sold</span><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/northbend.jpg\" alt=\"Sold home in North Bend, WA\"/></div>\n			<p style=\"margin:0.75rem 0 0\"><strong>North Bend, WA</strong></p>\n			<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"margin:0.15rem 0 0\">$1,272,000</p>\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-card tb-reveal\"} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-card tb-reveal\">\n			<div class=\"tb-sales-photo\"><span class=\"tb-sales-tag\">Sold</span><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/puyallup.jpg\" alt=\"Sold home in Puyallup, WA\"/></div>\n			<p style=\"margin:0.75rem 0 0\"><strong>Puyallup, WA</strong></p>\n			<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"margin:0.15rem 0 0\">$534,000</p>\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-card tb-reveal\"} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-card tb-reveal\">\n			<div class=\"tb-sales-photo\"><span class=\"tb-sales-tag\">Sold</span><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/covington.jpg\" alt=\"Sold home in Covington, WA\"/></div>\n			<p style=\"margin:0.75rem 0 0\"><strong>Covington, WA</strong></p>\n			<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"margin:0.15rem 0 0\">$795,000</p>\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-card tb-reveal\"} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-card tb-reveal\">\n			<div class=\"tb-sales-photo\"><span class=\"tb-sales-tag\">Sold</span><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/kenmore.jpg\" alt=\"Sold home in Kenmore, WA\"/></div>\n			<p style=\"margin:0.75rem 0 0\"><strong>Kenmore, WA</strong></p>\n			<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"margin:0.15rem 0 0\">$635,000</p>\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<section class=\"tb-listings-final\"><div class=\"tb-listings-final-inner\">\n <div class=\"tb-listings-kicker\">Your home could be next</div>\n <h2>Wondering what your move could look like?</h2>\n <p>Whether you are buying your first place, selling a longtime home, or simply curious about your options, Tanya will help you make the next step feel clear.</p>\n <div class=\"tb-listings-actions\" style=\"justify-content:center\"><a class=\"tb-listings-btn\" href=\"/sell/\">Sell With Tanya</a><a class=\"tb-listings-btn alt\" href=\"/contact/\">Start a Conversation</a></div>\n</div></section></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->', 'Listings', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '9-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-20 05:50:39', '2026-08-20 05:50:39', '', 9, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/?p=90211', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
