sales-tag\">Sold</span><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/kenmore.jpg\" alt=\"Sold home in Kenmore, WA\"/></div><p><strong>Kenmore, WA</strong></p><p class=\"tb-sold-price\">$635,000</p><p class=\"tb-sold-details\">3 Beds · 2.5 Baths · 1,664 SqFt</p><span class=\"tb-sold-more\">View property →</span></a></div></div></section>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<section class=\"tb-listings-final\"><div class=\"tb-listings-final-inner\">\n <div class=\"tb-listings-kicker\">Your home could be next</div>\n <h2>Wondering what your move could look like?</h2>\n <p>Whether you are buying your first place, selling a longtime home, or simply curious about your options, Tanya will help you make the next step feel clear.</p>\n <div class=\"tb-listings-actions\" style=\"justify-content:center\"><a class=\"tb-listings-btn\" href=\"/sell/\">Sell With Tanya</a><a class=\"tb-listings-btn alt\" href=\"/contact/\">Start a Conversation</a></div>\n</div></section></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->', 'Listings', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '9-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-20 06:10:24', '2026-08-20 06:10:24', '', 9, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/?p=90215', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
