rather than simply listing them.]</p><ul class=\"tbp-feature-list\"><li>[Open-concept living]</li><li>[Main-floor primary]</li><li>[Hardwood floors]</li><li>[Abundant natural light]</li></ul></div></section><section class=\"tbp-section reverse\"><div class=\"tbp-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/seattle.jpg)\"></div><div class=\"tbp-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Gather Here</div><h2>[The Kitchen + Living Spaces]</h2><p>[Tell the story of the kitchen, dining, and gathering spaces. Add appliance brands, materials, storage details, and connections to patios or views.]</p><ul class=\"tbp-feature-list\"><li>[Appliance highlight]</li><li>[Countertop material]</li><li>[Custom storage]</li><li>[Indoor-outdoor connection]</li></ul></div></section><section class=\"tbp-section\"><div class=\"tbp-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/shoreline.jpg)\"></div><div class=\"tbp-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Room to Exhale</div><h2>[Primary Suite + Additional Rooms]</h2><p>[Describe the primary suite, secondary bedrooms, office, bonus space, or flexible rooms. Connect the features to everyday life.]</p></div></section><section class=\"tbp-highlights\"><div class=\"tbp-highlights-inner\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#d6a3b5\">The Details</div><h2>What makes this home stand out</h2><div class=\"tbp-highlight-grid\"><div class=\"tbp-highlight\"><h3>[Outdoor living]</h3><p>[Patio, deck, garden, acreage, views, or entertaining details.]</p></div><div class=\"tbp-highlight\"><h3>[Major improvements]</h3><p>[Roof, HVAC, windows, systems, permits, or other high-value work.]</p></div><div class=\"tbp-highlight\"><h3>[Lifestyle feature]</h3><p>[Shop, studio, sport court, dock, RV parking, or community amenity.]</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"tbp-video\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">See the Home in Motion</div><h2 style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(2.3rem,4vw,4rem)\">Property tour</h2><div class=\"tbp-video-box\"><span>[Embed YouTube or Vimeo property video here]</span></div></section><section class=\"tbp-neighborhood\"><div class=\"tbp-neighborhood-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Around the Neighborhood</div><h2>[Location headline]</h2><p>[Explain what daily life is like here: commute, trails, parks, schools where appropriate, restaurants, shopping, and the character of the neighborhood. Link to Tanya’s related neighborhood guide.]</p><a class=\"tbp-btn\" href=\"/neighborhoods/\">Explore the Area</a></div><div class=\"tbp-map\"></div></section><section class=\"tbp-contact\"><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/gallery-2-new.jpg\" alt=\"Tanya Barrans\"><div class=\"tbp-contact-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Private Showings + Questions</div><h2>Let’s take a closer look.</h2><p>Want the disclosures, offer details, or a private tour? Tanya will make sure you have the context—not just the listing facts—to decide whether this home feels right.</p><div class=\"tbp-actions\"><a class=\"tbp-btn\" href=\"/contact/\">Ask Tanya About This Home</a><a class=\"tbp-btn alt\" href=\"tel:4255374728\">Call (425) 537-4728</a></div></div></section><aside class=\"tbp-note\"><strong>TEAM INSTRUCTIONS — REMOVE BEFORE PUBLISHING</strong><ul><li>Replace every item in brackets.</li><li>Use the hero photo plus at least 8–12 additional professional photos.</li><li>Keep only the room sections that add real value; duplicate an alternating section when needed.</li><li>Add accurate MLS facts, disclosures link, video, SEO title, meta description, and image alt text.</li><li>Confirm fair-housing-compliant language and all property facts before publishing.</li></ul></aside></div><!-- /wp:html -->', 'LISTING TEMPLATE — Duplicate Me', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '90216-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-20 06:20:37', '2026-08-20 